chor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":72,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-a3c524c5706e9086a5d6","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-38bd1853d4dfd8be726e","layer":"original","quote":"正元元年，诏曰：“故楚王彪，背国附奸，身死嗣替〖10〗；虽自取之，犹哀矜焉。夫含垢藏疾〖11〗，亲亲之道也；其封彪世子嘉，为常山真定王〖12〗。”","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":165,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-a4443ca5ed35223cc6e5","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-5af4c4c2541576c96c60","layer":"pei","quote":"王隐《晋书》载吏部郎李重启云：“魏氏宗室屈滞，每圣恩所存。东莞太守曹嘉，才干学义，不及志、翕；而良素修洁，性业逾之；又已历二郡。臣以为优先代之后，可以嘉为员外散骑侍郎。”","attribution":"裴注引王隐《晋书》","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":181,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-22c0a919d107f7824414","start":256,"end":341,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-b8faa29845bb8c98c50b","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-5af4c4c2541576c96c60","layer":"pei","quote":"嘉以诗遗崇曰：“文武应时用，兼才在明哲。嗟嗟我石生，为国之俊杰。入侍于皇闼，出则登九列。威检肃青、徐，风发宣吴裔。畴昔谬同位，情至过鲁、卫。分离逾十载，思远心增结。愿子鉴斯诚，寒暑不逾契。”","attribution":"裴注·曹嘉诗","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":181,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-22c0a919d107f7824414","start":59,"end":154,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-c2982e1cb6fa2a16767b","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-5af4c4c2541576c96c60","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞臣松之按：嘉，入晋，封高邑公。元康中，与石崇俱为国子博士。嘉后为东莞太守；崇为征虏将军，监青、徐军事，屯于下邳。嘉以诗遗崇曰：","attribution":"裴注·裴松之按","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":181,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-22c0a919d107f7824414","start":0,"end":66,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-d226f5be012fa843734b","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-5af4c4c2541576c96c60","layer":"pei","quote":"崇答曰：“昔常接羽仪，俱游青云中。敦道训胄子，儒化涣以融。同声无异响，故使恩爱隆。岂惟敦初好，款分在令终。孔不陋九夷，老氏适西戎。逍遥沧海隅，可以保王躬。世事非所务，周公不足梦。玄寂令神王，是以守至冲。”","attribution":"裴注·石崇诗","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":181,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-22c0a919d107f7824414","start":154,"end":256,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
